                "answer": 1,
                "explain": "'The children' is plural, so the verb has no s: play.",
                "rule": "A plural subject takes a verb with no s.",
                "practiceItems": [
                    {
                        "prompt": "'They ___ home.' (run)",
                        "answer": "run"
                    },
                    {
                        "prompt": "'We ___ a song.' (sing)",
                        "answer": "sing"
